cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: >-
  aeonia: R package and scripts for "Natural enemies can mediate the impact
  of plant-associated bacteria on insect-borne virus transmission"
abstract: >-
  R package that simulates aphid--parasitoid population dynamics and the
  spread of a nonpersistently transmitted, aphid-borne plant virus on grids
  of plants, some of which are inhabited by Pseudomonas bacteria, plus the
  scripts that run the simulations and create the figures for the manuscript
  "Natural enemies can mediate the impact of plant-associated bacteria on
  insect-borne virus transmission".
